  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Proceed through the dungeon while defeating enemies, and defeat the boss waiting in the deepest part to reach the ending. Collect as much GOLD as possible to reach the ending. The dungeon is a random generation that changes its shape every time you play. The deeper the floor, the wider it becomes. When you reach the goal, proceed to the next floor. If you don't know where the goal is, display the map screen (select button) and proceed in the direction where the end wall is not yet displayed."
    }
  ],
